      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "2018-09-10 Clear Skies"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "今天是教师节，学校里很多同学都买花送给老师。",
      "traditional": "今天是教師節，學校裡很多同學都買花送給老師。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shì jiào shī jié xué xiào lǐ hěn duō tóng xué dōu mǎi huā sòng gěi lǎo shī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "张老师教我们中文很认真，她是一个好老师。",
      "traditional": "張老師教我們中文很認真，她是一個好老師。",
      "pinyin": "zhāng lǎo shī jiāo wǒ men zhōng wén hěn rèn zhēn tā shì yí ge hǎo lǎo shī",
      "english": "Today is Teacher’s Day. A lot of classmates at school bought flowers for the teachers."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "我和露西、杰克等也买了花送给张老师。",
      "traditional": "我和露西、傑克等也買了花送給張老師。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ hé lù xī jié kè děng yě mǎi le huā sòng gěi zhāng lǎo shī",
      "english": "Teacher Zhang teaches us Chinese very diligently. She’s a great teacher."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Me, Lucy, Jack and some others also bought flowers to give to teacher Zhang."
    }
  ],
